      "surface": "updater-format",
      "id": "deploy-manifest",
      "introduced": "0.0.1",
      "notes": "Schema-versioned via MANIFEST_SCHEMA_VERSION in scripts/lib/lifecycle/manifest.ts (currently 1). Parsers hard-fail on a version mismatch; an old shim must keep parsing every in-window version."
    },
    {
      "surface": "updater-format",
      "id": "app-schema",
      "introduced": "0.0.1",
      "notes": "APP_SCHEMA_VERSION in scripts/lib/lifecycle/manifest.ts (currently 1): DDB item shapes, runtime-config keys, queue payload formats. Rollback preflight refuses downgrades across a bump."
    },
    {
      "surface": "updater-format",
      "id": "deploy-journal",
      "introduced": "0.0.1",
      "notes": "Immutable per-deploy event objects, scripts/lib/lifecycle/journal.ts (JournalEntry). Carries no standalone *_SCHEMA_VERSION constant yet; versioned implicitly with the manifest. TODO: converge with the release-pipeline work and give it an explicit constant."
    },
    {
      "surface": "updater-format",
      "id": "release-metadata",
      "introduced": "0.0.1",
      "notes": "Signed machine-readable release metadata (item 44). Schema-versioned via RELEASE_METADATA_SCHEMA_VERSION in scripts/lib/release/metadata.ts (currently 1). Old shims must keep parsing every in-window version."
    },
    {
      "surface": "updater-format",
      "id": "artifact-manifest",
      "introduced": "0.0.1",
      "notes": "Release artifact manifest: tag, commit, per-platform image digests, provenance (item 41). Schema-versioned via ARTIFACT_MANIFEST_SCHEMA_VERSION in scripts/lib/release/metadata.ts (currently 1)."
    },
    {
      "surface": "updater-format",
      "id": "key-rotation-metadata",
      "introduced": "0.0.1",
      "notes": "Signed trust-root rotation metadata the updater shim verifies with its pinned old roots (item 42). Schema-versioned via ROTATION_DOC_SCHEMA_VERSION in scripts/lib/release/signing.ts (currently 1)."
    },
